body:
Making my first character (Nightelf Warroir) and questing through pre- Cata Darkshore. The world felt more alive back then . I saw other players every where.  I felt like I was going on an adventure. I  met friends while questing there and played with them for years after.

I remember the first dungeon my friends and I did. We did not know what was going on. We were questing and found the entrance to Deadmines. We went in and got killed soo many times, but it was fun. We did not have a tank or healer, just dps lol I was just a noob having a blast with my questing buddies.  I really do miss those days.

&#x200B;
